<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Disclaimer | SpaniCentral</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/uploads/logo.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/privacy.css">

</head>

<body>

    <%- include("partials/navbar") %>

    <section class="page-header">

        <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

        <p>

            Please read this disclaimer carefully before
            using SpaniCentral.

        </p>

    </section>

    <section class="policy-container">

        <h2>General Information</h2>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral is an online job portal that shares
            employment opportunities from various employers
            across South Africa.

        </p>

        <p>

            The information published on this website is
            provided for general informational purposes only.

        </p>

        <h2>No Employment Guarantee</h2>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral does not guarantee that any user
            will obtain employment, an internship,
            a learnership, a graduate programme or any
            other opportunity listed on this website.

        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy of Information</h2>

        <p>

            We make every reasonable effort to ensure that
            job listings are accurate and up to date.

        </p>

        <p>

            However, employers may change, close or update
            vacancies without prior notice.

        </p>

        <p>

            Users are encouraged to verify all information
            directly with the employer before submitting
            applications.

        </p>

        <h2>External Websites</h2>

        <p>

            Many vacancies contain links to third-party
            websites.

        </p>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral is not responsible for the
            availability, content, security or privacy
            practices of those external websites.

        </p>

        <h2>Application Responsibility</h2>

        <p>

            Users are responsible for ensuring that the
            information they submit to employers is
            accurate and truthful.

        </p>

        <h2>Fraud Awareness</h2>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral does not charge applicants to
            apply for jobs.

        </p>

        <p>

            We encourage users to be cautious of scams and
            never pay money in exchange for employment
            opportunities.

        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>

        <p>

            SpaniCentral shall not be held responsible for
            any loss, damage or inconvenience arising from
            the use of this website or reliance on the
            information provided.

        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>

            If you have questions regarding this
            Disclaimer, please contact us through our
            Contact page.

        </p>

    </section>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>

    
</body>

</html>